.env
*.env
.venv/
venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
build/
.gradle/
*.class
.DS_Store
logs/
# runs/experiments.jsonl (the research trial log) stays gitignored -- it is
# a large, purely local research artifact (see research/experiment_log.py's
# DEFAULT_RUNS_PATH docstring). runs/live_signals.jsonl is the opposite: a
# low-volume, once-daily operational audit trail for the daily-tsmom-ensemble
# paper-trading signal runner (python/live/generate_daily_signal.py) that is
# deliberately git-committed, same treatment as any other operational log --
# see .planning/paper-trading-b-signal-runner.md. `runs/*` (not `runs/`)
# is required for the negation below to take effect -- git does not descend
# into a directory excluded via a bare trailing-slash pattern.
runs/*
!runs/live_signals.jsonl
python/data/var/
# ...and the same store wherever a wrong working directory puts it. On
# 2026-09-10 a `cd python && PYTHONPATH=.` invocation resolved
# DEFAULT_DB_PATH ("python/data/var/klines.sqlite3") relative to `python/`
# itself, creating `python/python/data/var/` -- which the anchored rule
# above does not match, so a 36K SQLite file reached main via a `git add
# -A`. Unanchored, so depth cannot defeat it again.
**/data/var/
# Locally-generated runtime data for the live paper-trading signal runner
# (python/live/generate_daily_signal.py) -- the signal file(s) it writes,
# mirroring python/data/var/'s existing gitignore treatment for the kline
# cache above.
var/live/
